   "displayId": "textTurn_exploreDataFromNL_1794703000000_closing",
   "textKind": "explain",
   "content": "**The US and the UK host the most international students:** 957,000 and 721,000. The largest hosts:\n\n- **US:** 957,000 (2023)\n- **UK:** 721,000 (2024)\n- **Australia:** 580,000 (2024)\n- **Canada:** 481,000 (2024)\n- **Germany:** 438,000 (2024)\n\nThese are students who crossed a border to study in higher education. The dashboard ranks the largest hosts and shows how the five largest grew since 2010; the map beside it sizes every host country by its number. Each country's latest figure from 2021–2026. Source: UIS, November 2026 release; indicator 26637.",
